OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1788961695
OL,3,CFamily of British racing driver thank
OL,4,Crival who saved his life after fiery
OL,5,Ccrash
OL,7,FThe wife of a British motor racing
OL,8,Fdriver who owes his life to a rival
OL,9,Fwho dragged him from the burning
OL,10,Fwreckage of a crashed car in China has
OL,11,Fgiven an update on his recovery.
OL,13,FOllie Millroy, 36, was competing in
OL,14,Fthe China GT Championship race in
OL,15,FShanghai on Saturday when he was
OL,16,Finvolved in a multi-car crash during
OL,17,Fthe seventh lap.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1788961695
OL,3,CFamily of British racing driver thank
OL,4,Crival who saved his life after fiery
OL,5,Ccrash
OL,7,FDutch racer Loek Hartog, 23, then
OL,8,Fabandoned his own vehicle instantly
OL,9,Fwith no flag marshals or fire crews in
OL,10,Fsight and doused the flames of
OL,11,FMillroy's Ferrari with a fire
OL,12,Fextinguisher before dragging him out.
OL,14,FMillroy, who was born in Windsor, said
OL,15,Fhe had survived the incident "thanks
OL,16,Fto one man" as his family said they
OL,17,Fowed the racer an "enormous amount of
OL,18,Fgratitude and love".
OL,26,@wD@^OUxD@KO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1788961695
OL,3,CFamily of British racing driver thank
OL,4,Crival who saved his life after fiery
OL,5,Ccrash
OL,7,FIn an update on Monday, Fern Millroy
OL,8,Fwrote on Instagram her husband had
OL,9,Fsuffered six broken ribs, broken his
OL,10,Fcollarbone and hand, and punctured a
OL,11,Flung.
OL,13,F"Ollie remains in a stable condition
OL,14,Fin the intensive care unit in
OL,15,FShanghai, surrounded by the most
OL,16,Fincredible doctors and surgeons," she
OL,17,Fsaid.
OL,26,@uD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1788961695
OL,3,CFamily of British racing driver thank
OL,4,Crival who saved his life after fiery
OL,5,Ccrash
OL,7,F"We have been blown away by the
OL,8,Fmessages of support and the love
OL,9,Fthat's been sent our way and it's
OL,10,Fgiven us the energy to keep pushing
OL,11,Fthrough this traumatic time of our
OL,12,Flives.
OL,14,F"Following a successful four hour
OL,15,Fsurgery yesterday, they have fitted
OL,16,Fplates and screws to the broken bones
OL,17,Fto ensure the best results in the
OL,18,Frecovery.
OL,26,@oD@AOUvD@AOU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1788961695
OL,3,CFamily of British racing driver thank
OL,4,Crival who saved his life after fiery
OL,5,Ccrash
OL,7,F"Ollie had another surgical procedure
OL,8,Ftoday to install a drain line to his
OL,9,Fabdomen, in order to release the gas
OL,10,Fand fluid leaking from his lung, which
OL,11,Fhas relieved a lot of pain and
OL,12,Fdiscomfort.
OL,14,F"The doctors are monitoring his
OL,15,Fcognitive state too, following a
OL,16,Fsevere concussion which resulted in
OL,17,Fhim blacking out for over an hour.
OL,19,F"The impact was so strong that it
OL,20,Fbroke his helmet visor and snapped his
OL,21,FHANS device."
OL,26,@oD@AOUvD@AOU{D@AOU}D@MO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
