OL,3,CFamily of British racing driver thank
OL,4,Crival who saved his life after fiery
OL,5,Ccrash
OL,7,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,FImmediately after the crash Millroy
OL,13,Fhad shared an emotional post thanking
OL,14,FHartog for his "incredible act of
OL,15,Fbravery" and declared he was only
OL,16,Falive because of him.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30408
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1788961695
OL,3,CFamily of British racing driver thank
OL,4,Crival who saved his life after fiery
OL,5,Ccrash
OL,7,F"I don't remember anything between 30
OL,8,Fseconds before the crash and one hour
OL,9,Fafter it, but I will remember his
OL,10,Fincredible act of bravery for the rest
OL,11,Fof my life," he wrote.
OL,13,F"One day I will tell our three kids
OL,14,Fthis story and Loek will be the
OL,15,Fbiggest superhero in history in their
OL,16,Feyes too."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G8/11
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,305,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30409
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F304A1788961695
OL,3,CFamily of British racing driver thank
OL,4,Crival who saved his life after fiery
OL,5,Ccrash
OL,7,FHartog responded to the post: "You
OL,8,Fhave nothing to thank me for. I wish
OL,9,Fto live in a world where this would
OL,10,Fnot be considered as bravery but as
OL,11,Finstinct of others too.
OL,13,F"I am so thankful to have been right
OL,14,Fat the place I needed to be in space
OL,15,Fand time. Speedy recovery and we will
OL,16,Fstay in close touch."
OL,26,@oD@_OU
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G9/11
