OL,3,CFamily of British racing driver thank
OL,4,Crival who saved his life after fiery
OL,5,Ccrash
OL,7,FHartog also thanked people for their
OL,8,Fmessages of support on his Instagram,
OL,9,Fand said he was glad to be going home,
OL,10,Fas the crash left him with "a lot of
OL,11,Fthoughts" in his mind.
OL,13,FOrganisers are reviewing the crash and
OL,14,Fhave vowed to formulate "more
OL,15,Fcomprehensive plans to address
OL,16,Fshortcomings in competition
OL,17,Forganisation, support, emergency
OL,18,Fresponse, rescue and medical services".
OL,26,@rD@\OUsD@IO]vD@YOUzD@fO]
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                   G10/11
